          <p class="mb-2"><b>Empowering Youth and Women as Educational Catalysts</b></p>
          <p>Involving youth and women in educational programs can significantly impact community engagement and education quality. With Gandhi Fellowship and Karuna Fellowship, Piramal Foundation underscores the importance of youth and women in strengthening educational outcomes, fostering gender inclusivity, and building resilient support systems for schools.
          </p>
          <p>Programs like Sangini mobilize young women to support educational initiatives and foster community involvement. By working with schools, local governments, and community leaders, these young fellows and women from different corners of the nation act as catalysts for long-term educational improvement. </p>
          <p>Watch how Vishnu Narayan, a Gandhi Fellow, tackled the overlooked issue of children begging near temples in Bihar by implementing a sustainable education initiative supported by the local community, transforming lives and creating lasting change. </p>
